    <string name="faq_title">Common questions</string>
    <string name="faq_pay_q">How do I pay?</string>
    <string name="faq_pay_a">Open Pay2Own, tap Pay now, and choose the installment that is due, several installments, or the full balance. Check the amount and your MoMo number, then approve the prompt on your phone with your MoMo PIN.</string>
    <string name="faq_miss_q">What happens if I miss a payment?</string>
    <string name="faq_miss_a">The installment stays due and Pay2Own keeps reminding you. Pay it as soon as you can. If this phone is enrolled for restrictions, it can be limited after a grace period. Emergency calls stay available.</string>
    <string name="faq_help_q">How do I get help?</string>
    <string name="faq_help_a">Use Call or WhatsApp on the support screen, or go back to the shop where you collected the phone.</string>

